[2026-11-01T23:33:53.638Z] [event=#13] [finding_published] actor=plan-scan-1 seq=#9 {"target":"all","content":"EMPIRICAL RECONNAISSANCE FINDINGS (plan-scan-1): (1) Membership Metrics: Total paid members 76.2M (Gold Star 63.7M, Business 12.5M), Total cardholders 136.8M (60.6M household cards). Executive members 35.4M (46.46% of paid members, driving 73.3% of sales). US/Canada renewal rate 92.9%, Worldwide 90.5%. Fee increase effective 2024-09-01: -> (Gold Star/Business), -> (Executive, max reward ,000->,250). (2) ASC 606 & Contra-Revenue: Executive 2% reward is contra-revenue sales reduction (,804M FY24, ,576M FY23, ,307M FY22). Deferred membership fees liability is ,501M. (3) Working Capital Float: Merchandise inventories ,647M vs Accounts Payable ,421M yields AP/Inventory = 104.15%, confirming suppliers fund 100%+ of merchandise inventory. (4) Preopening Expenses: Note 1 confirms preopening costs are folded into SG&A (not a separate line)."}
